# Governance Rules

## Promotion Rules

A strategy or analyst role can be promoted only if:

* minimum sample size is met
* expectancy is positive
* drawdown is within tolerance
* contribution is not redundant
* operational reliability is confirmed

## Demotion / Disable Rules

Disable or paper-only a source when:

* trailing edge materially decays
* regime-specific failure persists
* it adds cost without incremental value
* it creates unstable behavior or conflicts

## Manual Override Policy

Manual intervention is allowed only for:

* kill switch
* broker issue handling
* bad data / broken feed conditions
* emergency risk containment

Everything else should be logged and attributable.

